@startuml
title RF38 — Animações 3D por atributo, posição e estilo (IA do sistema) · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
actor "Administrador" as Admin
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "AuditService" as AuditService
control "AiAnimation" as AiAnimation
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
participant "Claude (LLM, narrativa)" as Claude
Admin -> Frontend: Gerar com IA (POSITION · WR rota funda)
Frontend -> API: POST /admin/animations/generate
API -> UseCase: AnimationAdminUseCases.generate
UseCase -> AiAnimation: gerar parâmetros
alt IA disponível
  AiAnimation -> Claude: prompt com limites do rig AF
  Claude --> AiAnimation: JSON de parâmetros
else fallback
  AiAnimation --> UseCase: template determinístico
end
UseCase -> MySQL: AnimationClip DRAFT
UseCase -> AuditService: ANIMATION_GENERATED
Admin -> API: POST /admin/animations/{id}/publish
API -> UseCase: publish: arquiva anterior
UseCase -> Redis: invalida catalog:animations
Manager -> API: GET /catalog/animations (ETag)
@enduml
